# Non-secret environment configuration — copy this to .env and adjust for your environment.
# Secrets (passwords, tokens, API keys) are stored in terraform/secrets.enc.yaml (SOPS-encrypted).
# They are injected automatically when you run: ./with-secrets <command>
#
# This file contains only deployment configuration that is safe to share and commit as a template.
# Your .env (actual values) is gitignored and should never be committed.
#
# Layering model:
#   1) .env
#   2) .env.<PVE_ENV> (defaults to .env.pve-test for ./with-secrets)
#
# Wrapper behavior:
#   - ./with-secrets defaults to PVE_ENV=pve-test and sources .env.pve-test
#   - caller-supplied PVE_ENV takes precedence over .env
#   - tracked examples for overlays live in .env.pve-test.template
#
# Base-vs-overlay contract:
#   - keep environment-agnostic shared defaults in .env
#   - keep target selection in .env.<PVE_ENV>
#   - for pve-test, set PVE_ENV / PROXMOX_* / TF_WORKSPACE / TF_VAR_proxmox_* in .env.pve-test
#
# Tracked examples for overlays live in:
#   - .env.pve-test.template
#   - .env.pve.template

